om/bdhirsh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Extracted a repro from an internal model:\r\n```\r\n+    def test_inductor_wait_followed_by_view(self):\r\n+        mesh = DeviceMesh(self.device_type, torch.arange(self.world_size))\r\n+\r\n+        # pass in tensor as inputs/outputs, create DTensor and run redistribute\r\n+        # (allgather collective) inside the fn\r\n+        def fn(x_dt):\r\n+            out = x_dt.redistribute(mesh, [Replicate()])\r\n+            return out.view(-1)\r\n+\r\n+        x = torch.ones(4, 4)\r\n+        x_dt = DTensor.from_local(x, mesh, [Shard(0)], run_check=False)\r\n+        opt_fn = torch.compile(fn, backend=\"inductor\", fullgraph=True)\r\n+        res = opt_fn(x_dt)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe (relevant) generated code looks like this:\r\n```\r\n        # collective out buffer buf0\r\n        buf1_pg = c10d._find_or_create_pg_by_ranks_and_tag('ptd:0', [0, 1], 2)\r\n        buf1_inputs = [arg0_1]\r\n        buf1 = [buf0]\r\n        buf1_work = dist.all_gather_into_tensor(buf1[0], buf1_inputs[0], async_op=True, group=buf1_pg)\r\n        fun_col_impl._register_tensor_work(buf1, buf1_work)\r\n        del arg0_1\r\n        buf2 = buf1[0]\r\n        del buf1\r\n        buf2 = _wait_tensor(buf2)\r\n        return (reinterpret_tensor(buf3, (32, ), (1, ), 0), )\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhere the code fails at runtime because `buf3` doesn't exist.\r\n\r\n\n\ncc @mrshenli @pritamdamania87 @zhaojuanmao @satgera @rohan-varma @gqchen @aazzolini @osalpekar @jiayisuse @H-Huang @kwen2501 @awgu @penguinwu @fegin @XilunWu @wanchaol @fduwjj @wz337 @tianyu-l @wconstab @yf225 @ezyang @msaroufim @anijain2305 @zou3519","closed_by":{"login":"bdhirsh","id":16311747,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzExNzQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16311747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh","html_url":"https://github.com/bdhirsh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdhirsh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/118759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/118759/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}